FT :
About the Department
Food Technology is a branch of engineering that focuses on the processing, preservation, and quality enhancement of food products to ensure safety, nutrition, and sustainability. It integrates principles of microbiology, chemistry, biotechnology, and engineering to develop innovative techniques for food production, packaging, and distribution. Food technologists work on advanced technologies such as food fortification, smart packaging, automation, and sustainable food processing to improve shelf life, taste, and nutritional value. With the growing demand for safe, healthy, and eco-friendly food solutions, the field continues to evolve, addressing challenges like food security, waste reduction, and alternative protein sources. As the global food industry advances, Food Technology plays a vital role in enhancing food quality, safety, and sustainability for a healthier future.

Department Details
HOD	Dr.R.Baskar (w.e.f 1.8.2022)
Intake	60
MTech Food Technology	18
Highlights
Category	Details
Laboratory & Research Facilities	Department has high-end instruments/equipment like HPLC, Texture Analyser, Colour Analyser, Water-activity meter, Crude fibre analyser, Spray drier, Infrared & Microwave Drier to provide hands-on experience and support research.
Research Scholars	20 research scholars have completed their PhD., 12 research scholars are currently pursuing their PhD in the research centre.
Funded Research Projects	Received Rs. 69 lakh worth of funding from UGC, DST, and AICTE to conduct research., 2 ongoing research projects worth Rs. 117.21 lakh.
Major Research Projects	TDT-WMT research project on 'Design and development of continuous high-pressure screw reactor for Alkali catalyzed hydrothermal co-liquefaction of plastic wastes with lignocellulosic biomass' funded by DST in 2021.
Funded Events	Conducted funded seminars, workshops, and conferences sponsored by ICMR, DST, DBT, MoES, NSTEDB, and AICTE worth Rs. 9.55 lakh., STTP Programme on 'Advances in bio and food products manufacturing and shelf life extension' funded by AICTE in 2019.
Placements	Consistently maintains good placement in leading food industries like ITC, Parle Agro, Hatsun Agro Pvt Ltd, Cavinkare Pvt Ltd, Milky Mist Dairy Food Pvt. Ltd., Dairy Day.
Industry Collaborations	Signed MoUs with industries and institutions including SKM Egg Private Limited, Vinu Foods, Angel Starch, Ivory Gull Candy, Milky Mist Dairy Food Pvt. Ltd., and Haddington Wines and Whiskies.
Certifications & Training	Department holds the esteemed status of being an FSSAI Empanelled Training Partner in the southern region with an approved trainer., Conducted 6 FosTac trainings for industries as well as students.
Entrepreneurship & Innovation	Agri Summit 2017 was conducted in coordination with TIE., Conducted 36-day Technological Entrepreneurship training programs (TEDP) twice during 2018 and 2019 funded by NSTEDB.
Consultancy Services	Offering testing and consultancy services in areas such as New Product Development, Shelf-life studies, Implementation of Quality Assurance, Process Know-hows, Quality & Safety training, and Water Analysis.
Student Achievements	Students received numerous prizes and awards for poster, paper, and project presentations at reputed institutions and professional bodies across India like IIT, NIT, TNAU, and AFSTI.
