ENGLISH :
About the Department
The Department as a Research Centre provides facility leading to the degree of Doctor of Philosophy in the fields of English Language Teaching (ELT), Indian Writing in English, Postcolonial Literature, Comparative Literature, Gender Studies, Literary Theory and Criticism, Eco-Criticism, Cultural Studies, Diaspora Studies, Translation Studies, and Digital Humanities.

Department Details
HOD	Dr.J.Rajini
Programmes Offered	Ph.D
Highlights
